## About
Forever Party Rentals is a family-run party rental company serving the Lower Mainland of British Columbia. We deliver, set up, and tear down marquee tents, Chiavari chairs, banquet and round tables, dance floors, battery power stations, and Starlink internet rentals across {{ city_count }} cities from Vancouver to Chilliwack. {{ fpr.aggregateRating.count }}+ five-star Google reviews.

## Policies
- 25% deposit secures any booking; the balance is due before delivery.
- 125% Cancellation Protection: if we cancel your booking, you receive 125% of your deposit back.
- 10% early-pay discount when the full balance is paid 30+ days before the event.
- On-time setup guarantee on every delivery.
